  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Satendra Singh Tomar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 15 March, 2021 Author: Sheel Nagu",
    "facts": "This is the first application filed u/S.439 Cr.P.C. for grant of bail by the petitioner. The petitioner has been arrested on 30/01/2021 by Police Station Sihoniya, District Morena (M.P.) in connection with Crime No.19/2021 registered in relation to the offence punishable u/Ss.420, 272, 273 of IPC and u/S.51, 57, 58 & 59 of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006. Learned counsel for the State opposed the application and prayed for its rejection by contending that on the basis of the allegations and the material available on record, no case for grant of bail is made out. The petitioner is in custody since 30/01/2021 in respect of aforesaid offences where allegation against the petitioner is of making spurious milk.",
